#76000
"Within a Darkened Wagon"
"Very little light penetrates this darkened area.  The sole source of
illumination is a single oil lamp, flickering feebly on the table in the
center of the room.  Shelves line the walls of this small room, each
displaying a chaotic variety of items.  Heavy curtains shroud the single
window in layers of faded crimson and violet brocade.  A thick layer of dust
coats everything in this stuffy room, further softening the already faded
colors of the cloth draped over the walls and table.  Directly in the center
of the small, square table sits a crystalline sphere, absorbing the light of
the nearby lamp.
"
"[Minqa] Reset crystal ball, takeable if Shora is dead.
[Minqa] Wagon 1
"
