#76001
"Before a Large Wagon"
"A richly colored wagon looms just ahead, painted in deep, luxurious shades of
crimson and violet.  Cascades of willow branches fall to either side of the
spacious abode, the leafy tendrils haloing the jewel toned colors with an aura
of pale, silvery green.  Even outside the wagon, the fragrance of incense long
since burned to dust lingers, heavy and sweet in the still air.  Tufts of
verdant grass grow wild, reaching ankle high, adding their fresh aroma to the
incense-laden air.
"
"[Minqa] Acode, enter wagon
"
