#76014
"Inside a Lavishly Decorated Wagon"
"An abundance of light spills into this large wagon through many windows cut
neatly into its sides.  Furnishings hewn of golden toned oak, polished to a
bright lustre and adorned with cushions and pillows in a myriad of colors,
decorate the living space, giving the place a comfortably lived in
appearance.  Both ends of the wagon are divided from the main living area by
intricately woven curtains, depicting beautiful patterns of abstract color. 
The light scent of a tangy herbal mixture lingers in the air.
"
"[Minqa] Wagon 2
"
