#76035
"Fenced-in Pastureland"
"A heap of fodder lies stacked in the southeastern corner of the pasture,
smelling sweetly of alfalfa and clover.  Wisps of golden hay lay strewn on the
pale grass, slivers of color against the unvarying silver-green backdrop.  A
single pine tree reaches heavenward just outside the fence, its outstretched
branches providing a measure of shade to this corner of the enclosure.  A
cloud of dust seems to hover over the road a ways to the east, evidence of the
passage of many travellers.
"
"[Minqa] Horsetrader
"
